---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

// Phase 5 Draft Route: Awaiting finalized pricing tiers and package thresholds (docs/CONTENT_INPUTS_NEEDED.md)
const draft = true;
---

<Base
  title="How We Price | Transparent Growth Engagements"
  description="Understand the SAPVIK transparent pricing models. Milestone-based project fees, verified monthly retainers, and direct platform ad billing."
  noindex={draft}
>
  <div class="pricing-page-section" style="padding-top: calc(var(--header-h) + 2.5rem); padding-bottom: 5rem;">
    <div class="container" style="max-width: 960px;">
      
      <!-- Draft Notice Banner -->
      <aside class="draft-indicator" aria-label="Draft Notice" style="margin-bottom: 2rem; background: #FFF9E6; border: 1px solid #FFE58F; padding: 0.85rem 1.25rem; font-size: 0.82rem; font-family: var(--font-mono); color: #874D00;">
        <strong>[DRAFT ROUTE &bull; NOINDEX]</strong> This pricing transparency page layout is prepared and excluded from the sitemap. Awaiting finalized baseline tier numbers and milestone structures per <code>docs/CONTENT_INPUTS_NEEDED.md</code>.
      </aside>

      <!-- Section Header -->
      <header class="section-head" style="margin-bottom: 3rem;">
        <span class="badge" style="margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">COMMERCIAL TRANSPARENCY</span>
        <h1 style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.5rem); font-weight: 800; color: var(--c-text-primary); margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">
          How We Price Our Services
        </h1>
        <p style="font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--c-text-secondary); line-height: 1.6; max-width: 760px;">
          Clear scope definitions, zero hidden commissions, and direct third-party media billing. We believe transparent pricing builds durable commercial partnerships.
        </p>
      </header>

      <!-- Pricing Principles Grid -->
      <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 3rem;">
        <div class="frame-box" style="padding: 1.75rem;">
          <span class="mono-label" style="color: var(--c-vermilion); display: block; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">PRINCIPLE 01</span>
          <h2 style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--c-text-primary); margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">
            Milestone Project Billing
          </h2>
          <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--c-text-secondary); line-height: 1.55; margin: 0;">
            Website and custom application builds are structured with clearly defined milestone payments tied directly to architectural sign-off and deployment.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="frame-box" style="padding: 1.75rem;">
          <span class="mono-label" style="color: var(--c-vermilion); display: block; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">PRINCIPLE 02</span>
          <h2 style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--c-text-primary); margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">
            Direct Platform Invoicing
          </h2>
          <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--c-text-secondary); line-height: 1.55; margin: 0;">
            100% of your advertising budget goes directly to Google Ads or Meta Ads through your company's own payment instrument. Direct invoicing from the advertising networks.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="frame-box" style="padding: 1.75rem;">
          <span class="mono-label" style="color: var(--c-vermilion); display: block; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">PRINCIPLE 03</span>
          <h2 style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--c-text-primary); margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">
            No Per-Seat SaaS Lock-In
          </h2>
          <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--c-text-secondary); line-height: 1.55; margin: 0;">
            You own your custom platforms, code repositories, and user databases. No ongoing per-user monthly software licensing fees.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Baseline Engagement Models -->
      <section class="frame-box" style="padding: 2rem; margin-bottom: 3rem;">
        <span class="mono-label" style="display: block; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">
          ENGAGEMENT MODELS
        </span>
        <h2 style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--c-text-primary); margin-bottom: 1.25rem;">
          Engagement Scope &amp; Structures
        </h2>
        <div style="background: var(--c-surface); border: 1px dashed var(--c-border); padding: 1.5rem; text-align: center; color: var(--c-text-muted); font-size: 0.92rem;">
          [Exact price ranges and starting package tiers will be published upon company leadership confirmation per <code>docs/CONTENT_INPUTS_NEEDED.md</code>]
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Transparent FAQs -->
      <section class="frame-box" style="padding: 2rem;">
        <span class="mono-label" style="color: var(--c-vermilion); display: block; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">
          PRICING QUESTIONS
        </span>
        <h2 style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--c-text-primary); margin-bottom: 1rem;">
          Frequently Asked Questions About Fees
        </h2>
        <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem;">
          <div style="border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--c-border); padding-bottom: 1rem;">
            <h3 style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--c-text-primary); margin-bottom: 0.25rem;">
              Do you require long-term lock-in contracts?
            </h3>
            <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--c-text-secondary); line-height: 1.55; margin: 0;">
              No. Our recurring retainers operate with transparent 30-day notice periods. We believe client retention should be earned through verified business performance.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--c-text-primary); margin-bottom: 0.25rem;">
              Are third-party hosting and domain costs included?
            </h3>
            <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--c-text-secondary); line-height: 1.55; margin: 0;">
              Infrastructure costs (e.g. Cloudflare, domain registrar) are paid directly by the client to ensure complete, independent administrative ownership.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
